   strojarstva i brodogradnje; Ss Cyril and Methodius University in Skopje
   (UKiM); Alumni Association of Electrical Engineers of East Sarajevo},
Abstract = {This paper presents a systematic review of datasets for hate speech and
   fake news detection, published between 2023 and 2024. Using Kitchenham's
   methodology, we analyzed reproducible studies that provide comprehensive
   documentation and accessibility. These challenges compromise research
   validity, making it difficult to build effective and universally
   applicable detection models. Despite advancements in machine learning,
   the development of effective detection models has been hindered by
   inconsistencies in data quality and annotation standards. This study
   highlights the need for highquality, diverse datasets that adhere to
   reproducibility standards and emphasizes the importance of incorporating
   multimodal data to improve model performance.},
